# The pre-#5308 head barrier: it waits only for the view to apply the copy it
# is bound to, so after a cutover it returns before the rebind.
MODULE: BarrierExactIgnoresSourceIdentity
TARGET: BarrierExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the head barrier returns once the bound copy is applied, whatever copy the alias names
PERTURBS: WaitHead

--- FIND
    /\ bound = phys /\ viewDefn = defn /\ read = Len(wal[phys])
--- REPLACE
    /\ read = Len(wal[bound])
--- END